##
## Acoustic model configuration for the offline Julius wake-word PoC.
##
## Run julius with -C pointing at this file plus -gram pointing at ./wake
## (the grammar prefix in this same directory), e.g. from the repo root:
##   julius -C scripts/julius-wake/am.jconf -gram scripts/julius-wake/wake \
##          -input rawfile -filelist <list-of-wav-paths>
##
## NOTE: Julius resolves relative paths written *inside* a -C config file
## relative to the directory containing that config file, not relative to
## the process's current working directory. So the -h/-hlist paths below
## are written relative to this file's own directory (scripts/julius-wake/),
## not relative to the repo root, even though the invocation above is run
## from the repo root.

-h ../../.tools/julius/dictation-kit/model/phone_m/jnas-tri-3k16-gid.binhmm
-hlist ../../.tools/julius/dictation-kit/model/phone_m/logicalTri-3k16-gid.bin

## EOF
